    "created_at": "2024-12-16T19:21:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-16T19:21:10Z",
    "body": "@ggedde that's why invokers are specific to button elements, for now.  because the accessibility of how they would work with buttons is known / there are mappings that can be made automatically.  putting such attributes on arbitrary elements would not come with automatic accessibility, because there are no consistent / expected mappings which would work for all elements - nor are many non-interactive elements expected to be keyboard focusable.  ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
